  "type": "v14-training-bugfix",
  "fixes": [
    "Questions such as １セット何回？ are no longer classified as workout logs",
    "Question detection now happens before log detection in training_intent.py",
    "Adds per-chat training context with 600 second TTL",
    "Follow-ups such as ？ / うん / はい can stay inside training context",
    "Acknowledgement fillers are added to attention-only terms to reduce accidental scene replay inheritance"
  ],
